HOW MONITORING WORKS:
An agent software is installed on the machine. The agent collects data, metrics, and logs, analyzes them, and visualizes/reports them. Alerts can be configured based on thresholds.

HELM - Package Manager for Kubernetes:

Helm is to Kubernetes what APT/YUM is to Linux.
Used to install, configure, and upgrade software in Kubernetes.
Helm Charts contain the application package.
values.yaml file contains configurable parameters/dependencies. Comment out what is not needed.
