Q&A HIGHLIGHTS:

Q: Why use two monitoring tools?
A: One for enterprise/production, one for dev/QA environments internally managed.

Q: Can Prometheus & Grafana be used outside Kubernetes?
A: Yes, but configuration is manual. It is best suited for Kubernetes environments.

Q: How does infra monitoring work?
A: An agent collects metrics and pushes them to a centralized location for analysis and alerting.

Q: Why not just use AI for troubleshooting?
A: AI gives generalized answers. It does not know your specific infrastructure. You need your own knowledge to apply fixes based on your environment.

Q: Why not store logs on the application server itself?
A: It increases machine size and cost. A centralized location is more efficient and scalable.
